{
  "title": "Indian construction has a robotics problem",
  "chapters": [],
  "lines": [
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "claim",
      "text": "A robot is painting walls in India now, and it doesn't even need a floor plan.",
      "emphasis": "floor plan",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "robot",
        "paint roller"
      ],
      "label": "PAINTING ROBOT",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "claim",
      "text": "Finishing a wall there is all hand work,",
      "emphasis": "hand work",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "hand",
        "wall"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "proof",
      "text": "putty, sanding, primer and paint, done by people.",
      "emphasis": "done by people",
      "visual": "icon_flow",
      "subjects": [
        "paint bucket",
        "sandpaper",
        "brush"
      ],
      "label": "PUTTY > SAND > PAINT",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "proof",
      "text": "Centa Painter takes over the big repetitive part.",
      "emphasis": "Centa Painter",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "CENTA PAINTER",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "proof",
      "text": "It rolls around carrying a spray tool,",
      "emphasis": "spray tool",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "wheel",
        "spray gun"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "proof",
      "text": "then swaps to a spinning sander for walls and ceilings.",
      "emphasis": "spinning sander",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "sander",
        "wall"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "pattern",
      "text": "It finds its way with a laser that measures distance,",
      "emphasis": "measures distance",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "laser"
      ],
      "label": "LIDAR",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "pattern",
      "text": "and cameras that spot windows and switchboards so it works around them.",
      "emphasis": "works around them",
      "visual": "icon_orbit",
      "subjects": [
        "camera",
        "window",
        "switch"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "pattern",
      "text": "From that it maps the room itself and plans how to cover every wall,",
      "emphasis": "maps the room",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "map",
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "OWN MAP",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "pattern",
      "text": "and it keeps checking, it sprays, looks at the pass and adjusts.",
      "emphasis": "adjusts",
      "visual": "icon_orbit",
      "subjects": [
        "spray gun",
        "eye"
      ],
      "label": "FEEDBACK LOOP",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "cost",
      "text": "But it's not doing the whole job.",
      "emphasis": "whole job",
      "visual": "cross_out",
      "subjects": [
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "cost",
      "text": "People still prepare the material, clean the pump and move it into place,",
      "emphasis": "move it into place",
      "visual": "checklist",
      "subjects": [
        "person",
        "bucket",
        "pump"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "cost",
      "text": "and the last ten centimetres near the edges are still done by hand.",
      "emphasis": "ten centimetres",
      "visual": "icon_pair",
      "subjects": [
        "ruler",
        "hand"
      ],
      "label": "LAST 10 CM",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "reframe",
      "text": "So this isn't a robot builder taking over,",
      "emphasis": "taking over",
      "visual": "cross_out",
      "subjects": [
        "robot"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "reframe",
      "text": "it's a machine that does the big flat walls the same way every time,",
      "emphasis": "same way every time",
      "visual": "icon_grid",
      "subjects": [
        "robot",
        "wall"
      ],
      "label": "",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
      "section": "reframe",
      "text": "while people handle the parts that keep changing.",
      "emphasis": "keep changing",
      "visual": "icon_hero",
      "subjects": [
        "person"
      ],
      "label": "SHARED WORK",
      "follow": false
    },
    {
      "chapter": 0,
